00:18:59.071 --> 00:19:01.305
 God smiles when
 you hate blackness,

508
00:19:01.306 --> 00:19:05.743
 so you beat that darkie
 in the name of the Almighty.

509
00:19:05.744 --> 00:19:07.411
 Hallelujah!

510
00:19:07.412 --> 00:19:09.148
 [MURMURING, GRUNTING]

511
00:19:11.349 --> 00:19:13.517
 People have lost
 their damn minds.

512
00:19:13.518 --> 00:19:14.985
 What's wrong with y'all?

513
00:19:14.986 --> 00:19:16.587
Hey! Hey!

514
00:19:16.588 --> 00:19:18.789
 That's right.
 Ronald Reagan said,

515
00:19:18.790 --> 00:19:21.692
 "Beat a nigga's ass
 and go to heaven. "

516
00:19:21.693 --> 00:19:23.326
 God is good.

517
00:19:23.327 --> 00:19:27.998
<i>? You shouldn't let yourself
 Go deeper ?</i>

518
00:19:27.999 --> 00:19:29.200
 [HUEY SIGHS]

519
00:19:29.201 --> 00:19:31.502
<i>? In distress ?</i>

520
00:19:31.503 --> 00:19:33.938
<i>HUEY:
 I never prayed before.</i>

521
00:19:33.939 --> 00:19:36.941
<i>I don't even know
 who I'm praying to.</i>

522
00:19:36.942 --> 00:19:39.210
<i>And maybe I'm too young
 to know</i>

523
00:19:39.211 --> 00:19:42.012
<i>what the world
 is supposed to be...</i>

524
00:19:42.013 --> 00:19:44.548
<i>but it's not supposed
 to be this.</i>

525
00:19:44.549 --> 00:19:46.684
<i>It can't be this.</i>

526
00:19:46.685 --> 00:19:49.220
<i>So please-</i>

527
00:19:49.221 --> 00:19:51.355
<i>? Oh, boy, don't cry ?</i>

528
00:19:51.356 --> 00:19:52.723
<i>? Over happiness... ?</i>

529
00:19:52.724 --> 00:19:55.092
 Governor.
 What is it?

530
00:19:55.093 --> 00:19:56.894
 They found out about Raoul.

531
00:19:56.895 --> 00:19:58.362
<i>? I believe in it ?</i>

532
00:19:58.363 --> 00:20:00.798
 Now, let us pray.

533
00:20:00.799 --> 00:20:03.901
 Lord, I have spent
 my whole life hatin' you

534
00:20:03.902 --> 00:20:06.037
<i>for makin' me black.</i>

535
00:20:06.038 --> 00:20:09.440
<i>And now I see I must hate
 myself and all those like me,</i>

536
00:20:09.441 --> 00:20:11.809
 and cause them misery,

537
00:20:11.810 --> 00:20:14.979
 just like your servant
 Ronald Reagan did.

538
00:20:14.980 --> 00:20:18.148
 And if any of my words
 don't come directly

539
00:20:18.149 --> 00:20:20.985
<i>from the Almighty God himself,</i>

540
00:20:20.986 --> 00:20:23.887
<i>then may I be struck
 by lightning</i>

541
00:20:23.888 --> 00:20:25.923
<i>right this very instant.</i>

542
00:20:25.924 --> 00:20:26.924
 Halle-!

543
00:20:26.925 --> 00:20:28.627
 [SCREAMING]

544
00:20:37.068 --> 00:20:38.870
 [PHONE RINGING]

545
00:20:44.542 --> 00:20:45.676
<i>? Just let the world... ?</i>

546
00:20:45.677 --> 00:20:46.710
 What just happened?

547
00:20:46.711 --> 00:20:47.778
 [RINGING]

548
00:20:47.779 --> 00:20:49.180
<i>? Go 'round ?</i>

549
00:20:49.181 --> 00:20:51.181
 Would somebody
 like to get that?

550
00:20:51.182 --> 00:20:53.683
<i>[RINGING]
 ? And 'round ?</i>

551
00:20:53.684 --> 00:20:56.620
<i>? And round?
 I think it's for me.</i>

552
00:20:56.621 --> 00:20:59.023
<i>HUEY: The lightning bolt
that saved Shabazz's life</i>

553
00:20:59.024 --> 00:21:01.826
<i>seemed to have struck
 Uncle Ruckus on his tumor.</i>

554
00:21:01.827 --> 00:21:03.293
<i>Doctors would find</i>

555
00:21:03.294 --> 00:21:04.863
<i>no remaining signs
 of his cancer.</i>

556
00:21:06.064 --> 00:21:07.197
<i>Some called it a miracle.</i>

557
00:21:07.198 --> 00:21:08.966
 [PEOPLE MURMURING]

558
00:21:08.967 --> 00:21:10.467
 MAN:
 It seemed to make sense.

559
00:21:10.468 --> 00:21:13.070
<i>HUEY: And maybe there are
forces in this universe</i>

560
00:21:13.071 --> 00:21:14.672
<i>we don't understand.</i>

561
00:21:14.673 --> 00:21:16.307
 Huh? Wha-?

562
00:21:16.308 --> 00:21:20.744
 Get your black
 banana-peelin' hands off of me.

563
00:21:20.745 --> 00:21:23.547
<i>HUEY: But I still believe
we make our own miracles.</i>

564
00:21:23.548 --> 00:21:26.383
<i>? Just let the world... ?</i>

565
00:21:26.384 --> 00:21:28.786
 I don't know how
 they found out about us,

566
00:21:28.787 --> 00:21:30.821
 but we have to end it, Raoul.

567
00:21:30.822 --> 00:21:32.556
 [SOBBING]

568
00:21:32.557 --> 00:21:36.526
<i>HUEY: Shabazz K.
Miltonburough was not yet free,</i>

569
00:21:36.527 --> 00:21:39.563
<i>but for now, the mission
 had been accomplished.</i>

570
00:21:39.564 --> 00:21:42.433
<i>I decided to take
 the rest of the day off.</i>

571
00:21:42.434 --> 00:21:44.702
<i>I wonder if there's
 anything good on TV.</i>

572
00:21:44.703 --> 00:21:46.305
 [?]